{"path":"/opt/cursor/artifacts/plans/lifeos_permissions_matrix_36131bb8.plan.md","streamContent":"---\nname: LifeOS Permissions Matrix\noverview: \"Complete LifeOS hackathon plan: agentic product definition, full feature catalog with 3-hour triage, screen IA, action schema, permissions + VpnService network control, Android/adb Cloud Agent environment, and a rigorous build/demo schedule.\"\ntodos:\n  - id: env-android-sdk\n    content: \"Install Android SDK, platform-tools (adb), build-tools, platforms; wire ANDROID_HOME/PATH; cloud-agent install/start scripts\"\n    status: pending\n  - id: env-validate-adb\n    content: \"Validate adb/sdkmanager/javac; snapshot; draft environment build; propose for Save\"\n    status: pending\n  - id: docs-feature-catalog\n    content: \"Write the feature catalog + 3hr triage + permissions matrix into .cursor/plans (merge/replace hackathon plan)\"\n    status: pending\n  - id: scaffold-android\n    content: \"Scaffold Kotlin Compose app with canonical manifest (incl. VPN service), Material 3, nav shell (Chat/Today/Goals/Wellbeing/More)\"\n    status: pending\n  - id: data-actions\n    content: \"AppState models + DataStore + ActionExecutor covering goals/tasks/habits/schedule/focus/network/alarms/memory/xp\"\n    status: pending\n  - id: agent-chat\n    content: \"Gemini JSON agent + offline demo fallback + Chat screen as primary agent surface\"\n    status: pending\n  - id: focus-vpn\n    content: \"FocusService overlay (whitelist mode) + LifeOsVpnService app-level network black/whitelist\"\n    status: pending\n  - id: schedule-wellbeing-goals\n    content: \"Today/Schedule calendar, Digital Wellbeing app controls, Goals/Todos screens wired to same AppState\"\n    status: pending\n  - id: alarms-onboarding-demo\n    content: \"Alarms/TTS, permission+VPN onboarding, seed demo, assembleDebug, demo script\"\n    status: pending\nisProject: false\n---\n# LifeOS — Complete Hackathon Plan (Agentic Android Prototype)\n\n**Product:** LifeOS — a personal AI operating system that does not only *plan*; it *executes and enforces*.  \n**Constraint:** Hackathon — ~3 hours of build time inside a ~4 hour submission window ([`context.txt`](context.txt)).  \n**Stack (locked):** Native **Kotlin + Jetpack Compose**, single-module Android app, Gemini Flash (JSON schema), local DataStore, no backend.  \n**Differentiator (locked):** Chat → structured actions → real device state (alarms, focus overlay, VPN network rules). Google/Apple will not ship opinionated distraction enforcement; that is the wedge ([`background/raw.txt`](background/raw.txt)).\n\nThis plan is the single source of truth for: **what the product is**, **every feature considered**, **what ships in 3 hours**, **permissions**, **VPN network control**, **UI surfaces**, **agent actions**, **data model**, **architecture**, **Cloud Agent env (SDK + adb)**, and **demo**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Product thesis (agentic)\n\nLifeOS is an **agent**, not a chatbot bolted onto a todo list.\n\n| Layer | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Intent** | User speaks naturally: goals, habits, focus, study, gym, deadlines, bedtime/morning routines |\n| **Plan** | Model returns persona `reply` + typed `actions[]` (never free-form tool soup) |\n| **Execute** | `ActionExecutor` mutates `AppState` and calls Android system APIs |\n| **Enforce** | FocusService (UI block) + LifeOsVpnService (network black/whitelist) + AlarmManager |\n| **Reflect** | Dashboard / Goals / Today / Wellbeing show the same state the agent just wrote |\n\n**Canonical user utterances the agent must handle in the prototype:**\n\n1. *\"Put my phone in focus mode with only Chrome, Docs, and LifeOS whitelisted.\"*\n2. *\"I have a DSA assignment due Tuesday; I keep doomscrolling Instagram; wake me at 7.\"*\n3. *\"Add gym Mon/Wed/Fri at 6:30pm and remind me 15 minutes before.\"*\n4. *\"I need to study OS for midterms — block YouTube and Instagram during study blocks.\"*\n5. *\"Every night remind me to submit LeetCode daily and brush teeth; tomorrow morning remind me to go to LHC.\"* (from [`raw.txt`](background/raw.txt))\n6. *\"Show what's on my schedule today and mark the graph practice task done.\"*\n\nIf the agent cannot turn (1)–(5) into **persisted state + at least one real OS effect**, the prototype failed.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Vision feature catalog → 3-hour triage\n\nDrawn from [`LifeOS_Startup_Vision.md`](background/LifeOS_Startup_Vision.md), [`context.txt`](context.txt), [`raw.txt`](background/raw.txt), and the prior prototype plan.  \n**Legend:** **P0** = must ship in 3h · **P1** = only if P0 green with ≥25 min left · **P2** = post-hackathon · **X** = impossible / Play-walled / wrong for demo.\n\n### 2.1 Agent & companion\n\n| ID | Feature | Triage | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| A1 | Chatbot as primary agent surface | **P0** | Bottom-nav Chat; every mutation prefer chat-first |\n| A2 | Structured actions JSON (`reply` + `actions[]`) | **P0** | Gemini `responseSchema`; offline hardcoded fallback |\n| A3 | Persistent life memory (`remember` facts → system prompt) | **P0** | List of strings; no vector DB |\n| A4 | Personality picker (3–5 presets) | **P0** | Supportive / Strict / Coach only for demo |\n| A5 | Full personality marketplace + evolving relationship arcs | **X/P2** | Vision-complete; not 3h |\n| A6 | Therapist / journaling / mood inference | **X** | Out of scope per prior plan; safety surface |\n| A7 | Voice input (`RECORD_AUDIO`) | **P2** | TTS output only in P0 (alarm line) |\n| A8 | Study assistant (quizzes/flashcards) | **P2** | Agent may *schedule study*; no content engine |\n| A9 | Work assistant (docs/code review) | **P2** | Same |\n\n### 2.2 Goals, todos, habits, schedule\n\n| ID | Feature | Triage | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| G1 | Goals (title, deadline, hard/soft) | **P0** | Create/update via agent + Goals screen |\n| G2 | Todo / task list (due, estMin, goal link, done) | **P0** | Chat + Todos section |\n| G3 | Deadline risk % (heuristic, not LLM) | **P0** | Instant, demo-safe arithmetic |\n| G4 | Today schedule / day calendar | **P0** | Time-ordered blocks from tasks + habits + alarms |\n| G5 | Multi-day / month calendar | **P1** | Week strip only if time; no full month |\n| G6 | Habits (recurring: gym, leetcode, brush teeth) | **P0** | `create_habit` + next occurrence on Today |\n| G7 | Habit templates pack (Study / Gym / Interview grind) | **P1** | Seed macros in system prompt; one-tap optional |\n| G8 | Adaptive replanning when behind | **P2** | Vision engine; fake with one `reschedule_task` action if needed |\n| G9 | Import roadmap / Kanban | **X** | Out |\n| G10 | Manual-only mode without agent | **P1** | Minimal “+” on Goals/Todos; agent remains primary |\n\n### 2.3 Focus, digital wellbeing, network\n\n| ID | Feature | Triage | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| F1 | Focus session start/stop | **P0** | Chat action + Wellbeing toggle |\n| F2 | **Whitelist** mode (only listed apps usable) | **P0** | User-requested; default demo mode |\n| F3 | Blacklist mode (block listed apps) | **P0** | Same FocusService; mode flag |\n| F4 | Overlay enforcement (`SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW`) | **P0** | XML overlay, not ComposeView |\n| F5 | Foreground detection (`PACKAGE_USAGE_STATS`) | **P0** | 800ms poll; no AccessibilityService |\n| F6 | Digital Wellbeing screen (per-app allow/block) | **P0** | App-wise toggles writing `FocusRules` |\n| F7 | Screen-time charts / weekly limits | **P1/P2** | Optional today-only minutes via UsageStats if easy |\n| F8 | **VPN network blacklist/whitelist** | **P0** | `VpnService`; app-level routing first |\n| F9 | Domain DNS sinkhole via VPN | **P1** | After app-level VPN works |\n| F10 | Accessibility-based instant block | **X** | Play + Android 17 APR risk |\n| F11 | True OS kill of other apps | **X** | No API |\n\n### 2.4 Alarms, reminders, accountability\n\n| ID | Feature | Triage | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| R1 | Exact alarms (`setAlarmClock`) | **P0** | Morning / bedtime / pre-gym |\n| R2 | Full-screen alarm + TTS persona line | **P0** | Demo alarm at T+60s |\n| R3 | Boot restore of alarms | **P0** | `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED` |\n| R4 | Escalating nag notifications | **P1** | Single notification channel enough for P0 |\n| R5 | Accountability copy in overlay (“Two days left”) | **P0** | Pull from active goal deadline |\n| R6 | Punishment system / reward engine | **P2** | XP/streak only (light gamification) |\n\n### 2.5 Gamification & health & integrations\n\n| ID | Feature | Triage | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| X1 | XP + streak on task complete / focus end | **P0** | Dashboard chips |\n| X2 | Skill trees / boss battles / achievements gallery | **P2** | |\n| X3 | Health Connect / workouts / sleep | **P2** | Gym = schedule habit, not HR |\n| X4 | Calendar provider sync | **P2** | In-app schedule only for 3h |\n| X5 | NotificationListener (Gmail/Classroom) | **P2** | |\n| X6 | Moodle / Piazza / ERP | **X** | Not a phone permission; server work |\n| X7 | Cloud sync / auth / iOS | **X** | |\n\n### 2.6 Triage summary (what we actually build)\n\n**P0 — ship these (the product):**\n\n1. Agentic Chat (Gemini + offline fallback + ActionExecutor)  \n2. Goals + Todos + Habits + Today schedule  \n3. Focus whitelist/blacklist + overlay + usage-stats detection  \n4. Digital Wellbeing (app-wise controls)  \n5. VPN app-level network black/whitelist  \n6. Alarms/reminders + TTS wake  \n7. Light XP/streak + deadline risk %  \n8. Memory facts + 3 personalities  \n9. Permission + VPN onboarding  \n10. Android Cloud env with **adb** + SDK (so we can build/sideload)\n\n**P1 — only after P0 works:** domain DNS filter, week strip, habit template chips, today’s screen-time minutes.  \n**Everything else:** deferred; do not start.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Information architecture (screens)\n\nBottom navigation (5 tabs). Chat is home.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  Chat[Chat Agent]\n  Today[Today Schedule]\n  Goals[Goals and Todos]\n  Wellbeing[Digital Wellbeing]\n  More[More]\n  Chat --> Exec[ActionExecutor]\n  Today --> State[AppState DataStore]\n  Goals --> State\n  Wellbeing --> State\n  Wellbeing --> Focus[FocusService]\n  Wellbeing --> Vpn[LifeOsVpnService]\n  Exec --> State\n  Exec --> Focus\n  Exec --> Vpn\n  Exec --> Alarms[AlarmManager]\n```\n\n| Tab | Purpose | Primary widgets |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Chat** | Agentic control plane | Message list, composer, “actions applied” chips, persona avatar |\n| **Today** | Schedule calendar (day) | Timeline of habits/tasks/alarms; tap to complete; “Start Focus” FAB |\n| **Goals** | Goal tracking + todo list | Goal cards with risk %; nested tasks; add manual todo |\n| **Wellbeing** | Digital wellbeing (app-wise) | Focus mode toggle; Whitelist/Blacklist segmented control; per-app switches; Network restriction toggle; active VPN badge |\n| **More** | Onboarding re-entry, personality, memory facts, XP/streak, about | Permission status checklist; clear demo reset |\n\n**No** separate Habits tab — habits appear on Today and are created via Chat.  \n**No** card-soup dashboard as home — Chat is home; Today/Goals show outcomes.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Agentic action schema (complete for P0)\n\nEvery model response:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"reply\": \"string — persona voice\",\n  \"actions\": [ { \"type\": \"string\", \"...\": \"...\" } ]\n}\n```\n\n### 4.1 Action catalog\n\n| `type` | Fields | Effect |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `create_goal` | `title`, `deadline?`, `hardness`=`soft\\|hard` | Upsert goal |\n| `update_goal` | `id` or `title`, patch fields | Patch |\n| `create_task` | `title`, `goal?`, `due?`, `estMin?` | Todo |\n| `complete_task` | `id` or `title` | Marks done; +XP |\n| `create_habit` | `title`, `rrule` or `daysOfWeek[]`, `time`, `remindMinutesBefore?` | Habit + next instances on Today |\n| `add_schedule_block` | `title`, `start`, `end`, `kind`=`study\\|gym\\|deep_work\\|other` | One-off calendar block |\n| `set_alarm` | `time` or `atIso`, `personaLine`, `label?` | `setAlarmClock` |\n| `cancel_alarm` | `id` or `label` | Cancel |\n| `focus_start` | `mode`=`whitelist\\|blacklist`, `minutes?` | Starts FocusService |\n| `focus_stop` | — | Stops focus |\n| `focus_set_apps` | `mode`, `packages[]` | Sets allow/block list |\n| `network_mode` | `mode`=`off\\|blacklist\\|whitelist` | VPN policy mode |\n| `network_set_apps` | `packages[]` | Apps for VPN allow/disallow |\n| `network_set_domains` | `domains[]` | P1 DNS list |\n| `remember` | `fact` | Memory list |\n| `set_persona` | `id` | Persona |\n| `award_xp` | `amount`, `reason` | Rare; usually executor-derived |\n\n### 4.2 Example — whitelist focus (user ask)\n\nUser: *\"Focus mode with only Chrome, Docs, and LifeOS.\"*\n\n```json\n{\n  \"reply\": \"Focus is on. Everything else gets the wall. Chrome, Docs, LifeOS only.\",\n  \"actions\": [\n    {\"type\":\"focus_set_apps\",\"mode\":\"whitelist\",\"packages\":[\"com.android.chrome\",\"com.google.android.apps.docs\",\"com.lifeos.app\"]},\n    {\"type\":\"network_mode\",\"mode\":\"whitelist\"},\n    {\"type\":\"network_set_apps\",\"packages\":[\"com.android.chrome\",\"com.google.android.apps.docs\",\"com.lifeos.app\"]},\n    {\"type\":\"focus_start\",\"mode\":\"whitelist\",\"minutes\":50},\n    {\"type\":\"remember\",\"fact\":\"Prefers whitelist focus with Chrome+Docs\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### 4.3 Offline fallback (mandatory)\n\nHardcode responses for 3 demo prompts (DSA+Instagram+7am; whitelist focus; gym habit). If `GEMINI_API_KEY` missing or HTTP fails → fallback. Demo never dies on Wi‑Fi.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Data model (`AppState`)\n\nSingle JSON blob in DataStore (skip Room for speed).\n\n```text\nAppState\n  personaId\n  memoryFacts: string[]\n  goals: Goal[]        // id, title, deadline, hardness, createdAt\n  tasks: Task[]        // id, goalId?, title, due, estMin, done, completedAt?\n  habits: Habit[]      // id, title, daysOfWeek, timeHHmm, remindMinutesBefore\n  scheduleBlocks: Block[]  // id, title, start, end, kind\n  alarms: Alarm[]      // id, triggerEpoch, label, personaLine\n  focus: FocusRules    // active, mode, packages[], startedAt, endsAt?\n  network: NetworkRules // mode, packages[], domains[]\n  wellbeing: { perAppOverrides: map package -> allow|block|default }\n  gamification: { xp, streakDays, lastActiveDate }\n```\n\n**Deadline risk (deterministic):**  \n`riskScore = clamp(0..100, f(estRemainingMin, focusMinUntilDeadline, completionRate7d))`  \nDisplay as “On track / At risk / Critical” + percent.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Enforcement architecture\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  User[User utterance] --> Chat\n  Chat --> LLM[Gemini or Fallback]\n  LLM --> Exec[ActionExecutor]\n  Exec --> Store[DataStore AppState]\n  Exec --> AlarmMgr[AlarmManager setAlarmClock]\n  Exec --> FocusSvc[FocusService FGS]\n  Exec --> VpnSvc[LifeOsVpnService]\n  FocusSvc --> Usage[UsageStatsManager poll]\n  FocusSvc --> Overlay[TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY]\n  VpnSvc --> Builder[VpnService.Builder]\n  Builder --> AppRoutes[addAllowed / addDisallowedApplication]\n  Builder --> DnsStub[Optional local DNS P1]\n  Store --> TodayUI[Today]\n  Store --> GoalsUI[Goals]\n  Store --> WellUI[Wellbeing]\n```\n\n### 6.1 FocusService (UI)\n\n- FGS `specialUse`, ongoing notification “Focus active”.\n- Every 800ms: `queryEvents` last 2s → foreground package.\n- **Whitelist:** if fg ∉ packages ∪ critical system → show overlay.\n- **Blacklist:** if fg ∈ packages → show overlay.\n- Overlay XML: title, goal-aware subtitle, **Back to work** (HOME), **Override** (10 min escape, logs fact).\n\n### 6.2 LifeOsVpnService (network)\n\n- User consent: `VpnService.prepare()`.\n- **App-level (P0):** `addAllowedApplication` (whitelist) or `addDisallowedApplication` (blacklist). Always allow LifeOS + `SYSTEM_CRITICAL_ALLOW` (dialer, system UI).\n- **Domain-level (P1):** local DNS stub on TUN.\n- Ongoing notification “Network guard on”.\n- Does **not** replace overlay; complements it.\n\n### 6.3 Alarms\n\n- `SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM` gated.\n- Demo: schedule `now+60s` when user says “test alarm” or from seed button in More.\n- BootReceiver rebuilds from `AppState.alarms`.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Permissions matrix (rigorous)\n\n### 7.1 Canonical manifest\n\n| Permission / artifact | Why | Grant path |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `INTERNET` | Gemini | Install |\n| `POST_NOTIFICATIONS` | FGS + alarms fallback | Runtime |\n| `VIBRATE` | Alarm/overlay haptic | Install |\n| `WAKE_LOCK` | Short wake for alarm/focus | Install |\n| `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED` | Restore alarms/focus intent | Install |\n| `SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM` | Exact reminders | Settings intent |\n| `USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT` | Alarm UI | Install; fallback if revoked |\n| `FOREGROUND_SERVICE` | Focus + VPN | Install |\n| `FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE` + property | A14+ FGS type | Install + Play form later |\n| `PACKAGE_USAGE_STATS` | Detect fg app | Usage access Settings |\n| `SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW` | Block overlay | Overlay Settings |\n| `BIND_VPN_SERVICE` (service) | Network guard | VPN prepare dialog |\n| `<queries>` MAIN/LAUNCHER | App picker | N/A |\n\n### 7.2 Feature → permission map\n\n| Feature | Permissions |\n| --- | --- |\n| Chat / Gemini | `INTERNET` |\n| Goals/Todos/Habits/Today/XP | none (local) |\n| Notifications | `POST_NOTIFICATIONS` |\n| Alarms + TTS alarm | `SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM`, `USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT`, `VIBRATE`, `WAKE_LOCK`, `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED` |\n| Focus overlay | `PACKAGE_USAGE_STATS`, `SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW`, FGS\\* |\n| Wellbeing app list | `<queries>`, UsageStats optional for minutes |\n| Network black/white | `BIND_VPN_SERVICE`, `INTERNET`, FGS\\* |\n| Memory / persona | none |\n\n### 7.3 Onboarding order (5 grants)\n\n1. Notifications  \n2. Exact alarms  \n3. Usage access  \n4. Display over other apps  \n5. VPN / network control (`VpnService.prepare`)  \n\nWellbeing and Focus buttons stay disabled until 3–5 verified.\n\n### 7.4 Explicitly forbidden for this prototype\n\n`AccessibilityService`, `QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES`, `USE_EXACT_ALARM`, `READ_SMS`, `READ_CALL_LOG`, `REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS`, background location, Device Admin, root/`iptables`.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Cloud Agent environment (SDK + adb)\n\n| Item | Choice |\n| --- | --- |\n| JDK | System 21 |\n| SDK root | `/opt/android-sdk` |\n| Components | cmdline-tools, **platform-tools (adb)**, build-tools;34.0.0, platforms;android-34 |\n| Emulator | Skip (no KVM); use `adb devices` / `adb connect` |\n| install | `scripts/cloud-agent-install.sh` — sdkmanager licenses + packages; smoke `adb version` |\n| start | `scripts/cloud-agent-start.sh` — export PATH, `adb start-server`, print devices |\n| Secrets | `GEMINI_API_KEY` via Cursor secrets (optional if offline fallback) |\n\nWorkflow: local green → snapshot → draft `trigger-environment-build` → fresh agent verify → `propose-environment-json` → user Saves.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Three-hour build schedule (rigorous)\n\n| Window | Deliverable | Exit criteria |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 0:00–0:20 | Env scripts + SDK/adb if not ready; Gradle Compose scaffold; full manifest; nav shell | `adb version` OK; app launches empty tabs |\n| 0:20–0:40 | `AppState` + DataStore + seed + ActionExecutor stubs | Unit: apply JSON actions → state changes |\n| 0:40–1:10 | Chat UI + Gemini client + schema + 3 offline fallbacks | Demo utterance fills Goals/Today without API |\n| 1:10–1:30 | Goals + Todos + Today timeline UI | Manual complete task → XP |\n| 1:30–2:00 | FocusService whitelist/blacklist + overlay | Leave app → blocked package shows overlay |\n| 2:00–2:20 | LifeOsVpnService app-level network mode | `prepare` + whitelist strips network from Chrome test |\n| 2:20–2:35 | Wellbeing screen wired to FocusRules + NetworkRules | Toggles == chat actions |\n| 2:35–2:50 | Alarms + TTS + boot receiver + onboarding | T+60s alarm fires |\n| 2:50–3:00 | Icon, seed demo button, APK, record 90s demo | Sideload via adb |\n\n**Parallelism (2 people):** A = Chat/LLM/Goals/Today · B = Focus/VPN/Alarms/Onboarding · merge on `AppState` + ActionExecutor.\n\n**Cut order if behind:** P1 DNS → week strip → screen-time minutes → TTS (keep notification) → VPN domains (keep app-level) → personality count (ship 1). **Never cut:** Chat actions, Focus overlay, Today list, offline fallback.\n\n---\n\n## 10. Demo script (90 seconds)\n\n1. **Onboarding** — show grants including VPN (pre-grant on device before recording).  \n2. **Chat:** DSA due Tuesday + Instagram doomscroll + wake at 7 → Goals risk %, tasks, alarm, blacklist Instagram.  \n3. **Chat:** “Focus whitelist Chrome + Docs + LifeOS” → Wellbeing shows whitelist; Start Focus.  \n4. Open Instagram → **overlay**; show network guard badge.  \n5. **Today** — gym habit + bedtime LeetCode reminder visible.  \n6. Alarm (pre-set 60s) → full-screen + TTS.  \n7. Task complete → XP/streak bump.\n\n---\n\n## 11. Risks and mitigations\n\n| Risk | Mitigation |\n| --- | --- |\n| No Gemini / bad Wi‑Fi | Offline fallbacks for 3 prompts |\n| Emulator has no Instagram | Use YouTube/Chrome as stand-in packages |\n| Usage access empty | Onboarding verify AppOps before Focus enable |\n| VPN consent scary | Copy: on-device focus filter, not remote VPN |\n| Overlay Compose tax | XML View only |\n| 3h overrun | Cut order in §9 |\n| OEM kills FGS | Demo on Pixel/stock Android 14/15 |\n\n---\n\n## 12. Deliverables after plan approval (execution)\n\n1. Cloud env with Android SDK + **adb** validated, snapshot/build/propose.  \n2. Permissions + feature catalog committed under [`.cursor/plans/`](.cursor/plans/) (update/replace [`lifeos_hackathon_prototype_7372d322.plan.md`](.cursor/plans/lifeos_hackathon_prototype_7372d322.plan.md)).  \n3. If still in scope for the same execution pass: P0 Android app per §9 until `assembleDebug` + adb install evidence.  \n4. Do not implement P2 vision items. Do not use AccessibilityService.\n\n---\n\n## 13. Acceptance criteria (definition of done)\n\n- [ ] `adb version` and `sdkmanager --list_installed` show platform-tools + android-34  \n- [ ] App installs via `adb install`  \n- [ ] Chat applies ≥1 offline multi-action utterance end-to-end into Goals/Today/Wellbeing  \n- [ ] Whitelist focus blocks a non-whitelisted app with overlay  \n- [ ] VPN mode can be consented and started; app-level whitelist/blacklist applied  \n- [ ] Alarm fires within demo window with visible full-screen or notification fallback  \n- [ ] Permissions onboarding lists all five special grants with verification  \n- [ ] No P2 features started; cut order respected if timeboxed\n"}
````

