### P0 in 3 hours (ship)
Agent chat + offline fallbacks · Goals/Todos/Habits · Today timeline · Focus **whitelist/blacklist** + overlay · Digital Wellbeing app controls · **VpnService** app-level network black/whitelist · Alarms/TTS · XP/streak + deadline risk % · 5-step permission onboarding · Android SDK + **adb** env

